// The base game's trader conversations. Talk to a trader and TraderGreeting plays; when it ends, the
// window offers every topic attached to that trader - these two, plus any a mod adds - and Goodbye.
//
// Headers: kind is Greeting, Topic or Ambient; attach says who it belongs to (asked of the Speaker,
// in the condition language barks use); requires says what else must be true; a Topic's label is
// the choice that offers it; once: true means never again for a squad that has seen it.
// SmoresDialogReport facts lists every fact, function and effect a script may use.
//
// Compile with: ysc compile trader.yarn -o . -n trader

title: TraderGreeting
kind: Greeting
attach: Speaker.Role == trader
---
Trader: Buying or selling? #line:trader_greet
-> Show me what you've got. #line:trader_greet_trade
    <<OpenTrade>>
-> Just looking. #line:trader_greet_looking
    Trader: Look with your eyes, then. #line:trader_greet_eyes
===

// Haggling-flavoured, with no haggling in it: prices stay flat. Asking the right way sets a flag
// that unlocks the backstory below.
title: TraderPrices
kind: Topic
attach: Speaker.Role == trader
label: Any chance of a better price?
---
Trader: Prices are prices. The road doesn't haggle, and neither do I. #line:trader_prices
-> Not even for a regular? #line:trader_prices_regular
    Trader: Nine years I walked the salt road to learn what things cost. I don't sell that cheap. #line:trader_prices_salt_road
    <<SetFlag trader_mentioned_salt_road>>
-> Fair enough. #line:trader_prices_fair
===

// A backstory, standing in for recruit backstories until recruiting exists: it waits on a flag, and
// is told once.
title: TraderBackstory
kind: Topic
attach: Speaker.Definition == Trader
requires: Flag(trader_mentioned_salt_road)
once: true
label: You walked the salt road?
---
Trader: Nine years, with a cart and a mule that hated me. #line:trader_story_mule
Trader: The mule died at the dry wells. I didn't, which is the only reason I'm standing here. #line:trader_story_wells
-> And the cart? #line:trader_story_cart
    Trader: Sold it. The first thing I ever sold at a profit. #line:trader_story_profit
-> I'm glad you made it. #line:trader_story_glad
    Trader: So am I. Most days. #line:trader_story_most_days
===
